  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"De\u011Fnek D\xF6rtl\xFCs\xFC\" kart\u0131n\u0131
    \"ters\" se\xE7tin {{isim}}.\n\nYa\u015Fam\u0131n, zihninde \xE7izdi\u011Fin
    sanal raylarda senin istedi\u011Fin istikamette ilerlememi\u015F. Bu kart, hayal
    k\u0131r\u0131kl\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 ve ba\u015Far\u0131s\u0131zl\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131
    anlat\u0131yor. Sen elinden geleni yapmana ra\u011Fmen \xF6n\xFCne pek \xE7ok
    engel \xE7\u0131km\u0131\u015F. K\xF6\u015Feye s\u0131k\u0131\u015Fm\u0131\u015F,
    \xE7\xF6z\xFCm yolu bulamam\u0131\u015F, baz\u0131 planlar\u0131n\u0131 ertelemi\u015F,
    kimini de iptal etmi\u015Fsin. De\u011Firmenini d\xF6nd\xFCrecek su kalmad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    anlad\u0131\u011F\u0131nda ise b\xFCnyeni huzursuzluk kaplam\u0131\u015F. Ruhsal
    birtak\u0131m dengesizlikler ya\u015Fam\u0131\u015F, ne yapaca\u011F\u0131na,
    ne hissedece\u011Fine ya da ne s\xF6yleyece\u011Fine karar verememi\u015Fsin.
    Israrla gelmesini bekledi\u011Fin baz\u0131 haberler bir t\xFCrl\xFC gelmemi\u015F."
